[en.C34]
Unicornia

[en.C34_DEF]
Unicornia

[en.C34_ADJ]
Eastern Unicorn

[en.C34_peacism_party]
Sable Dynasty

[en.PIHC_WS_C34_desc]
Long before the Three Tribes Covenant of Equestria, many ponies and unicorns had established civilization in the east of Equestria, on the Kirinthal continent. Different from the cyclical civilization of the Kirin, the eastern unicorns established a stable country that lasted for thousands of years here - Unicornia.
Legend has it that when Unicornia was still a small city-state kingdom, Sable Spirit has already become the Empress. However, at first, she relied on powerful magic to seize the throne by force. In order to make herself more beautiful than Mistmane, she used magic to absorb the beauty of the entire country. After learning about it, Mistmane defeated Sable Spirit and sacrificed her own beauty in exchange for the revival of the entire country, and also made the aging Sable Spirit beautiful again.
Since then, Empress Sable Spirit, who was moved by Mistmane’s selfless spirit, began to learn from Mistmane, and shared her beauty with the entire country of Unicornia. Unicornia thus became the most beautiful place in Equestria — only that most ponies outside did not know of the existence of this place.
Sable Spirit herself had high magical talent, after being purified by Mistmane’s magic, coupled with the power of friendship brought by sharing love and practicing good governance, Sable Spirit has not aged for thousands of years. Today, she is still in the palace, blessing the entire Unicornia, but there are also rumors that she is already overwhelmed and has long been looking for an heir to the throne; there are even some outrageous rumors that she has died hundreds of years ago, and the current Sable Spirit is just a disguised corpse, and the real beauty magic comes from the countless unicorns secretly employed by Unicornia government.

[en.C34_DESC]


[zh.C34]
独角兽仙境

[zh.C34_DEF]
独角兽仙境

[zh.C34_ADJ]
东方独角兽

[zh.C34_peacism_party]
紫影王朝

[zh.C34_DESC]
早在小马利亚三族盟约的许久许久之前，东方独角兽们在这里建立了一个持续数千年的稳定国家 —— 独角兽仙境。被雾鬃的无私精神所感动的女皇紫影朱灵开始向雾鬃学习，将自己的美丽用魔法分享给整个仙境的小马。独角兽仙境因此成为了小马利亚最美丽的地方 —— 只不过外界大多数小马并不知道这个地方的存在。
紫影朱灵本就拥有较高的魔法天赋，又经过雾鬃的魔法净化，再加上分享爱意施行善政带来的友谊的力量，紫影朱灵在数千年间竟然再也未曾衰老。如今，她仍在皇宫中，祝福着整个独角兽仙境，但也有传言说她已经力不从心，早就在寻找王位的继承者了；更有一些过分的传言说，她已经在数百年前就已经死去，现在皇宫中的紫影朱灵只是一具经过伪装的遗体，而真正的美丽魔法来自于独角兽仙境政府秘密雇佣的无数独角兽。

[zh.C34_welcome_desc]
Long before the Three Tribes Covenant of Equestria, the eastern unicorns established a stable country that lasted for thousands of years here - Unicornia. Empress Sable Spirit, who was moved by Mistmane’s selfless spirit, began to learn from Mistmane, and shared her beauty with the entire country of Unicornia. Unicornia thus became the most beautiful place in Equestria — only that most ponies outside did not know of the existence of this place.
Sable Spirit herself had high magical talent, after being purified by Mistmane’s magic, coupled with the power of friendship brought by sharing love and practicing good governance, Sable Spirit has not aged for thousands of years. Today, she is still in the palace, blessing the entire Unicornia, but there are also rumors that she is already overwhelmed and has long been looking for an heir to the throne; there are even some outrageous rumors that she has died hundreds of years ago, and the current Sable Spirit is just a disguised corpse, and the real beauty magic comes from the countless unicorns secretly employed by Unicornia government.

[zh.PIHC_WS_C34_desc]
早在小马利亚三族盟约的许久许久之前，在东方的麒麟索尔就早已经有许多小马与独角兽建立了文明。不同于麒麟的轮回式文明，东方独角兽们在这里建立了一个持续数千年的稳定国家 —— 独角兽仙境。
传说中，在独角兽仙境还是一个很小的城邦王国时，紫影朱灵就已经成为了女皇。只不过起初，她依靠强大的魔法力量武力夺取了皇位。为了让自己比雾鬃更加美丽，用魔法吸取了整个国家的美丽。雾鬃得知后击败了紫影朱灵，同时牺牲自己的美貌换取整个国家的复兴，也让容貌衰老的紫影朱灵的重新美丽。
从那之后，被雾鬃的无私精神所感动的女皇紫影朱灵开始向雾鬃学习，将自己的美丽用魔法分享给整个仙境的小马。独角兽仙境因此成为了小马利亚最美丽的地方 —— 只不过外界大多数小马并不知道这个地方的存在。
紫影朱灵本就拥有较高的魔法天赋，又经过雾鬃的魔法净化，再加上分享爱意施行善政带来的友谊的力量，紫影朱灵在数千年间竟然再也未曾衰老。如今，她仍在皇宫中，祝福着整个独角兽仙境，但也有传言说她已经力不从心，早就在寻找王位的继承者了；更有一些过分的传言说，她已经在数百年前就已经死去，现在皇宫中的紫影朱灵只是一具经过伪装的遗体，而真正的美丽魔法来自于独角兽仙境政府秘密雇佣的无数独角兽。

